      "https://learn.microsoft.com/windows/security/threat-protection/auditing/event-4720"
    ],
    "falsepositives": [
      "正規の入退社・アカウント発行運用(発生頻度が高い)"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "sigma-added-to-admin-group",
    "title": "特権グループへのメンバー追加 (T1098)",
    "level": "high",
    "tags": [
      "attack.t1098",
      "attack.persistence"
    ],
    "logsource": {
      "service": "security"
    },
    "detection": {
      "selection": {
        "EventID": [
          "4728",
          "4732",
          "4756"
        ]
      },
      "condition": "selection"
    },
    "description": "特権グループ(Administrators / Domain Admins 等)へのメンバー追加(EventID 4728/4732/4756)。権限昇格・永続化の兆候。追加された主体と実行者、直前のアカウント作成との相関を確認する。",
    "references": [
      "https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/",
      "https://learn.microsoft.com/windows/security/threat-protection/auditing/event-4732"
    ],
